<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>사라진 숫자 보석 사건 - 꼬마 탐정 스도쿠</title>
<!-- PWA 설정: manifest.json, sw.js, icon-192.png, icon-512.png 가 이 파일과 같은 폴더에 있을 때만 동작합니다 -->
<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#e8a13c">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<!-- iOS 홈 화면 앱 지원 -->
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="꼬마 탐정">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="icon-192.png">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jua&family=Gowun+Dodum&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --paper:#fff8e7; --ink:#4a3b2a; --accent:#e8a13c; --gold:#f5c542;
  --good:#4caf6d; --bad:#ef7d7d; --card:#fffdf5;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
body{
  font-family:'Gowun Dodum',sans-serif; color:var(--ink);
  background:#7fb2d9;
  background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#7fb2d9 0 20px,#86badf 20px 40px);
  min-height:100vh; display:flex; justify-content:center; padding:12px;
}
#app{
  width:100%; max-width:420px; background:var(--paper);
  background-image:radial-gradient(#00000008 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:8px 8px;
  border-radius:18px; border:3px solid #b98a4e;
  box-shadow:0 8px 30px #0004; padding:14px; position:relative;
}
h1,h2,h3,.jua{font-family:'Jua',sans-serif;}
button{font-family:inherit; min-height:48px; min-width:48px; cursor:pointer;
  border-radius:12px; border:2px solid #b98a4e; background:#ffe9bd; color:var(--ink);
  font-size:1.05rem; padding:8px 14px; transition:transform .08s;}
button:active{transform:scale(.96);}
button:focus-visible,[tabindex]:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #2b7cd3; outline-offset:2px;}
/* 상단 고정 바 */
#topbar{position:sticky; top:0; z-index:10; background:var(--paper); border:2px dashed #b98a4e;
  border-radius:12px; padding:8px; margin-bottom:12px;}
#topbar .row{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
#badge{font-size:.85rem; background:#fff; border:1px solid #b98a4e; border-radius:20px; padding:2px 10px;}
#gold-slots{display:flex; gap:6px; margin:6px 0;}
.gold-slot{width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:8px; border:2px solid #c9a227; background:#fff;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-family:'Jua'; font-size:1.4rem; color:#c9a227;}
.gold-slot.filled{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffe27a,#f5c542); color:#5b4300; box-shadow:0 0 8px #f5c542;}
#progress{display:flex; gap:3px;}
#progress .seg{flex:1; height:10px; border-radius:5px; background:#e5d9c0; border:1px solid #b98a4e;}
#progress .seg.done{background:var(--good);}
/* 캐릭터 */
.char{width:90px; height:90px; flex:none;}
.chief-speech,.raccoon-speech{display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:flex-end; margin:10px 0;}
.bubble{background:#fff; border:2px solid #b98a4e; border-radius:14px; padding:10px 12px;
  font-size:1rem; line-height:1.5; position:relative; flex:1;}
/* 스도쿠 판 */
#board{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:4px; max-width:320px; margin:10px auto;}
#board .cell{aspect-ratio:1; border:2px solid #b98a4e; border-radius:8px; background:var(--card);
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-family:'Jua'; font-size:1.7rem; cursor:pointer;}
#board .cell.blank{background:#fff; color:#2b7cd3;}
#board .cell.selected{outline:4px solid #e8a13c; background:#fff3d6;}
#board .cell.mark{border-color:#c2185b; background:#ffe3ee;}
#board .cell.correct{background:#d8f3dc;}
#board .cell.wrong{background:#ffdada;}
#board .cell:nth-child(4n+1){border-left-width:4px;}
#board .cell:nth-child(-n+4){border-top-width:4px;}
#board .cell:nth-child(n+13){border-bottom-width:4px;}
#board .cell:nth-child(4n){border-right-width:4px;}
#board .cell:nth-child(n+5):nth-child(-n+8){border-bottom-width:4px;}
/* 숫자 버튼 */
#numpad{display:flex; gap:8px; justify-content:center; margin:10px 0;}
#numpad button{width:60px; height:60px; font-family:'Jua'; font-size:1.6rem; background:#fff;}
/* 퀴즈/선택 */
.choice{display:block; width:100%; margin:8px 0; font-size:1.15rem; background:#fff;}
/* 단서 카드 */
.clue-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#ffeec7); border:2px solid #c9a227; border-radius:12px;
  padding:8px 12px; margin:6px 0; box-shadow:2px 2px 6px #0002;}
.clue-card.golden{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffe27a,#f5c542); border:3px solid #a67c00;}
/* 도장 */
.stamp{display:inline-block; border:4px solid #d33; color:#d33; border-radius:50%;
  padding:6px 14px; font-family:'Jua'; transform:rotate(-12deg); font-size:1.2rem;
  animation:stampIn .4s ease;}
@keyframes stampIn{0%{transform:scale(2.5) rotate(-12deg); opacity:0;}100%{transform:scale(1) rotate(-12deg); opacity:1;}}
@keyframes pop{0%{transform:scale(.3);}70%{transform:scale(1.15);}100%{transform:scale(1);}}
.pop{animation:pop .5s ease;}
/* 돋보기 힌트 버튼 */
#hint-btn{border-radius:50%; width:56px; height:56px; font-size:1.5rem; background:#dff0ff; border-color:#2b7cd3;}
#notebook-btn{background:#e6ffe6; border-color:#3a7d44;}
.toolbar{display:flex; gap:8px; justify-content:center; margin:8px 0;}
.feedback{border-radius:12px; padding:10px 12px; margin:10px 0; line-height:1.5; display:none;}
.feedback.ok{display:block; background:#d8f3dc; border:2px solid var(--good);}
.feedback.no{display:block; background:#ffe3e3; border:2px solid var(--bad);}
.feedback.hint{display:block; background:#dff0ff; border:2px solid #2b7cd3;}
.center{text-align:center;}
.big-btn{font-size:1.2rem; padding:12px 24px; background:var(--accent); color:#fff; border-color:#a86f1e; font-family:'Jua';}
input[type=text]{min-height:48px; font-size:1.1rem; padding:8px; border-radius:10px; border:2px solid #b98a4e; width:100%; font-family:inherit; background:#fff;}
details{margin-top:16px; border-top:2px dashed #b98a4e; padding-top:8px; font-size:.9rem;}
summary{cursor:pointer; min-height:48px; display:flex; align-items:center;}
table{border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:.8rem;}
td,th{border:1px solid #b98a4e; padding:3px 5px;}
#password-show{font-family:'Jua'; font-size:3rem; letter-spacing:12px; color:#a86f1e; text-align:center;}
.cert{border:4px double #a86f1e; padding:16px; background:#fffbe8; text-align:center; margin:10px 0;}
/* 종이 사건파일 느낌으로 밝은 화면 고정 (다크모드에서 글자가 안 보이던 문제 수정) */
:root{color-scheme:light;}
/* ===== 훈련 모드 ===== */
#board.n4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); max-width:320px;}
#board.n6{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr); max-width:330px; gap:3px; width:100%;}
#board.n6 .cell{font-size:1.25rem; border-radius:6px;}
#board.n9{grid-template-columns:repeat(9,1fr); max-width:340px; gap:2px; width:100%;}
#board.n9 .cell{font-size:1rem; border-radius:4px;}
#board .cell.related{background:#e8f1ff;}
#board .cell.blank.related{background:#e8f1ff;}
#board .cell.same-num{background:#cfe3ff; box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px #2b7cd3;}
@keyframes hintFlash{0%,100%{background:#fff;}50%{background:#ffe27a; box-shadow:0 0 14px #f5c542;}}
#board .cell.hintflash{animation:hintFlash .9s ease 3;}
#numpad.wrap{flex-wrap:wrap; max-width:360px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;}
#numpad.wrap button{width:52px; height:52px; font-size:1.3rem;}
.map-zone{border:2px dashed #b98a4e; border-radius:14px; padding:10px; margin:10px 0; background:#fffdf5;}
.map-zone h3{margin-bottom:8px;}
.lv-card{display:inline-flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  width:96px; min-height:88px; border-radius:14px; border:3px solid #b98a4e; background:#fff;
  margin:6px; font-family:'Jua'; position:relative; padding:6px 4px;}
.lv-card.open{background:#ffe9bd; cursor:pointer;}
.lv-card.done{background:#d8f3dc; border-color:var(--good); cursor:pointer;}
.lv-card.locked{background:#e5e0d4; color:#8a8378; border-color:#b0a890; cursor:not-allowed;}
.lv-card .stars{color:#e8a13c; font-size:.95rem; min-height:1.1em;}
.lv-card .stampmini{position:absolute; top:-8px; right:-8px; font-size:1.1rem;}
.lv-row{display:flex; gap:4px;}
.lv-row.rev{flex-direction:row-reverse;}
.loading-box{text-align:center; padding:40px 10px;}
@keyframes spinMag{0%{transform:rotate(0);}100%{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
.loading-box .mag{display:inline-block; font-size:3rem; animation:spinMag 1.2s linear infinite;}
</style>
</head>
